The two tables in this folder (tile_scores.csv, pixel_counts.csv) are derived from the STARCOP dataset:

  Ruzicka, V., Mateo-Garcia, G., Gomez-Chova, L., Vaughan, A., Guanter, L., Markham, A.
  "STARCOP dataset: Semantic Segmentation of Methane Plumes with Hyperspectral Machine Learning Models", v1.0.
  Zenodo, 2023. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7863343
  Licensed CC BY-NC 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  (The Kaggle mirror's "MIT" label is not the dataset's licence.)

Derived content and changes made: test-tile identifiers, acquisition dates, flights, emission rates (qplume) and annotation
mask pixel counts come from the dataset's test.csv and label masks; the per-tile statistic and the tp/fp/fn/tn counts come
from the released STARCOP checkpoints (isp-uv-es/starcop, CC BY-NC 4.0) and from the raw mag1c enhancement product applied to
those tiles, as saved by the plume operating-budget audit of 2026-10-11. The records were reformatted from JSON to CSV; the
per-tile score hashes were dropped. No other change. No imagery, checkpoint or score map is included.

